WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.965 position:50% size:90% align:center
Local Python app · SD-Turbo
Apple MPS with CPU offloading

00:00:04.065 --> 00:00:11.065 position:50% size:90% align:center
Enter an English description.
The classifier scores seven emotion labels.

00:00:13.215 --> 00:00:19.314 position:50% size:90% align:center
Choose a style and an optional seed.
This run uses Nature and seed 17.

00:00:19.414 --> 00:00:26.414 position:50% size:90% align:center
Generate a 512 × 512 image with SD-Turbo.

00:00:42.684 --> 00:00:48.492 position:50% size:90% align:center
Review the generated image.

00:00:48.592 --> 00:00:55.194 position:50% size:90% align:center
Review text emotion scores,
valence and arousal estimates.

00:00:55.294 --> 00:01:01.899 position:50% size:90% align:center
Inspect the prompt built from your text,
style, color and lighting cues.

00:01:01.999 --> 00:01:06.682 position:50% size:90% align:center
Download the generated image as a PNG.

00:01:06.782 --> 00:01:11.162 position:50% size:90% align:center
Download a report with the image,
prompt and analysis.

00:01:11.262 --> 00:01:18.262 position:50% size:90% align:center
Try a new seed while keeping
the same text and style.

00:01:31.724 --> 00:01:36.836 position:50% size:90% align:center
Review the new image.
The text and style stay the same.

00:01:36.936 --> 00:01:42.253 position:50% size:90% align:center
Select an earlier image to restore
its prompt, scores and seed.

00:01:42.353 --> 00:01:48.957 position:50% size:90% align:center
Analyze text → build a prompt →
generate an image.

00:01:49.057 --> 00:01:53.660 position:50% size:90% align:center
Return to the selected image.
